{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["And darkness, וימש — like ״ולא יהל״; Aramaic, like ״לא יאהל״. That is: the darkness of night would grow dim and deepen for a prolonged time — there was no illumination of night for three days."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {0 "Rashbam reads וימש as cognate with the Aramaic root for 'spreading a tent/canopy,' i.e., the darkness 'canopied over'; rendered 'grow dim and deepen' for יאמיש ויאפיל."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:41:00.224649556Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}